  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Savant Beauty Club (SBC) redefines luxury with timeless, high-quality beauty products crafted for sophisticated individuals who value excellence. From our premium hair extensions to carefully curated beauty essentials, SBC embodies elegance, confidence, and durability. By joining the Savant Beauty Club affiliate program, you&rsquo;re aligning with a trusted brand that delivers uncompromising quality and empowers its partners to earn while sharing what they love.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Product description:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Our collection features&nbsp;<strong>luxury Raw Indian Hair Extensions</strong>&nbsp;that are:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">100% raw and unprocessed for unmatched quality.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Odor-free, tangle-free, and designed to last up to six years with proper care.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Available in multiple textures: curly, deep wavy, wavy, and straight.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Offered in natural brown and 613 colors, catering to diverse beauty preferences.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Future additions include luxury wig units and exclusive beauty bundles, ensuring affiliates always have sought-after products to promote.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Long-Lasting Quality</strong>: Hair extensions that remain beautiful for years, making them a worthwhile investment for your customers.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Luxury Made Accessible</strong>: Premium products that deliver professional-level results without compromise.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exclusivity and Trust</strong>: Represent a brand known for luxury and a loyal customer base.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>High Conversion Potential</strong>: SBC products are sought-after, giving affiliates an edge in sales.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong></strong>&bull; Payment terms:&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Commission Rate</strong>: 10% on every sale made through your unique affiliate link.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Payout Schedule</strong>: Payments are made monthly via PayPal or direct deposit.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Cookie Duration</strong>: 30-day tracking ensures you earn commission even if purchases are delayed.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Minimum Payout Threshold</strong>: $50.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Other information:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Affiliate Resources</strong>: Access to marketing materials, including banners, product images, and social media templates, to make promoting effortless.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Support</strong>: Dedicated affiliate support team to assist with any questions or concerns.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Promotional Opportunities</strong>: Affiliates will have the chance to earn bonuses during special campaigns, including product launches and seasonal sales.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Program Flexibility</strong>: Work on your own schedule and promote in a way that aligns with your personal brand.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>",
